  "authorNotes": "Scope: দ্বীনের প্রথম পাঠ printed pp 34–48 (PDF pp 35–49; the PDF runs one page ahead) and পরিবার ও পরিবেশ পরিচিতি printed pp 9–22 (PDF pp 7–20). The book PDFs use a legacy font, so the text was read from page images. The MP 2026 Class 2 Islam paper only partly matches this scope: its Mu'adh ibn Jabal hadith items, 'first account on Judgement Day is salat', the 'ইসলামের দাবি' question, 'আখিরাত কাকে বলে' and two matching pairs ('ভুল হলে সাথে সাথে ভালো কাজ', 'মানুষের হক') are not on pp 34–48, so they were left out. One MP 2026 MCQ had '৫টি' printed twice as an option — fixed. MP Half-yearly 2026/2025 papers use the same two books (earlier pages), and their in-scope items were reused. Items were chosen so that no question gives away another's answer (e.g. the MP 2026 'প্রকাশ্য ইবাদত' fill-in and true/false were dropped because the sorting table tests exactly that). Doubts: (1) Row 7 is either kalima or dua; I chose two kalimas because no dua appears in the syllabus pages. Kalima shahadat is on p.37; kalima tayyiba is not printed by that name in the book (only its meaning as the first pillar) — swap it if the class learned a different kalima. Arabic text in the answer key should be checked by the Islam teacher. (2) The book cites Surah an-Nahl 'আয়াত ৯৬' for the good-life verse (it is usually 16:97); no question depends on the verse number. (3) Duration '৩ ঘণ্টা' is a guess (MP was 2 h 30 min)."
